      "text": "[9:30PM] #Ijanikin #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood traffic movement from Abule-Ado to Under bridge Trade Fair.\nOjo Barracks to Volkswagen bus stop is moving faster, also Afolabi Ege Fruits market to Iyana Iba is good down to Iyana Iba intersection.\n\nOkokomaiko inw Iyana Isashi is good at the moment, Cele Nisa to Ketu Aiyetoro, Iyana Era, Vespa down to Ijanikin Custom Checkpoint is good.\n\nLasu Igando road is good from Iyana Iba to Obadore bridge.\nReturn journey back to Iyana Iba under bridge is also good.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
